You may read the public documentation and download and execute the
unaltered official installer/migration scripts for the limited purpose
of installing, updating, migrating, or operating an official release
on systems you are authorized to manage. Necessary local copies for
that purpose are permitted. Use of the proprietary application is
subject to the activation/license actually issued and any separate
applicable software terms.

