4. THIRD-PARTY RIGHTS
Names, marks, libraries, services, and other third-party materials
remain subject to their respective owners' rights and licenses.
Nothing in this notice changes those separate terms.

5. RESEARCH AND RISK
Published replay, backtest, and simulation results are research
materials, not actual-account performance claims or guarantees.
Trading may involve substantial or total capital loss. Materials are
provided without any guarantee of fitness, uninterrupted operation,
